            <ArticleTitle>Taxing sugar-sweetened beverages: the fight against obesity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000428818.57256.0c</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Increased consumption of sugar-sweetened beverages has been identified as a key contributor in the obesity epidemic. Taxing these beverages is currently a hot topic for healthcare providers, manufacturers, and legislators. Whether a tax will help trim American waist lines remains questionable.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
